  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis minus 4 left parenthesis y plus 7 right parenthesis equals 117\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>117</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis plus 4 left parenthesis y plus 7 right parenthesis equals 442\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>442</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"6 left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>",
