  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"1,677\"><mn>1,677</mn>\n</math>. Adding the first equation to the second equation in the given system yields <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis plus left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis plus left parenthesis negative 4 right parenthesis left parenthesis y plus 7 right parenthesis plus 4 left parenthesis y plus 7 right parenthesis equals 117 plus 442\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>117</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>442</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"2 left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis equals 559\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>559</mn></math>. Multiplying both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"6 left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis equals 1,677\"><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1,677</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"6 left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis\"><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"1,677\"><mn>1,677</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
